T*
(   [ 0 0 0 0 ]) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Count non-zero rows:) Tj
T*
(   Row 1 is non-zero \(pivot at column 1\).) Tj
T*
(   Row 2 is non-zero \(pivot at column 3\).) Tj
T*
(   Rows 3 and 4 are entirely zero.) Tj
T*
(   The number of non-zero rows in the Row Echelon Form is 2.) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   Rank\(A\) = rho\(A\) = 2.) Tj
