(>> Solution to Question 14:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Verify the Cayley-Hamilton Theorem for matrix A = [[1, 0, 3], [2, 1, -1], [1, -1, 1]], and hence compute A^-1 and A^4.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Compute Characteristic Equation det\(lambda*I - A\) = 0:) Tj
T*
(   Characteristic polynomial: lambda^3 - S1*lambda^2 + S2*lambda - S3 = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - S1 = Trace\(A\) = 1 + 1 + 1 = 3.) Tj
T*
(   - S2 = Sum of principal minors:) Tj
T*
(   M11 = det\([1 -1; -1 1]\) = 1 - 1 = 0.) Tj
T*
(   M22 = det\([1 3; 1 1]\) = 1 - 3 = -2.) Tj
T*
(   M33 = det\([1 0; 2 1]\) = 1 - 0 = 1.) Tj
T*
(   S2 = 0 + \(-2\) + 1 = -1.) Tj
T*
(   - S3 = det\(A\) = 1\(1 - 1\) - 0 + 3\(-2 - 1\) = 0 - 0 - 9 = -9.) Tj
T*
(   Characteristic equation: lambda^3 - 3*lambda^2 - lambda + 9 = 0.) Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Verification of Cayley-Hamilton Theorem: A^3 - 3*A^2 - A + 9*I = O:) Tj
T*
(   Compute A^2:) Tj
T*
(   A^2 = [1 0 3; 2 1 -1; 1 -1 1] * [1 0 3; 2 1 -1; 1 -1 1]) Tj
T*
(   = [ 1*1+0+3*1, 0+0-3*1, 3*1+0+3*1 ] [ 4 -3 6 ]) Tj
T*
(   [ 2*1+1*2-1*1, 0+1*1+1*1, 6-1-1 ] = [ 3 2 4 ]) Tj
T*
(   [ 1*1-1*2+1*1, 0-1*1-1*1, 3+1+1 ] [ 0 -2 5 ]) Tj
T*
(   Compute A^3 = A^2 * A:) Tj
T*
(   A^3 = [ 4 -3 6; 3 2 4; 0 -2 5 ] * [ 1 0 3; 2 1 -1; 1 -1 1 ]) Tj
T*
(   = [ 4-6+6, 0-3-6, 12+3+6 ] [ 4 -9 21 ]) Tj
T*
(   [ 3+4+4, 0+2-4, 9-2+4 ] = [ 11 -2 11 ]) Tj
T*
(   [ 0-4+5, 0-2-5, 0+2+5 ] [ 1 -7 7 ]) Tj
T*
(   Now evaluate A^3 - 3*A^2 - A + 9*I:) Tj
T*
(   - 3*A^2 = [ 12 -9 18; 9 6 12; 0 -6 15 ]) Tj
T*
(   - A^3 - 3*A^2 = [ 4-12, -9-\(-9\), 21-18; 11-9, -2-6, 11-12; 1-0, -7-\(-6\), 7-15 ] = [ -8 0 3; 2) Tj
T*
(   -8 -1; 1 -1 -8 ]) Tj
T*
(   - \(A^3 - 3*A^2\) - A = [ -8-1, 0-0, 3-3; 2-2, -8-1, -1-\(-1\); 1-1, -1-\(-1\), -8-1 ] = [ -9 0 0; 0) Tj
T*
(   -9 0; 0 0 -9 ] = -9*I) Tj
T*
(   - Therefore: A^3 - 3*A^2 - A + 9*I = -9*I + 9*I = O. \(Verified\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Compute A^-1:) Tj
T*
(   Multiply characteristic equation by A^-1:) Tj
T*
(   A^2 - 3*A - I + 9*A^-1 = O => 9*A^-1 = -A^2 + 3*A + I) Tj
T*
(   -A^2 + 3*A + I:) Tj
T*
(   -A^2 = [ -4 3 -6; -3 -2 -4; 0 2 -5 ]) Tj
T*
(   3*A = [ 3 0 9; 6 3 -3; 3 -3 3 ]) Tj
T*
(   I = [ 1 0 0; 0 1 0; 0 0 1 ]) Tj
T*
(   Sum = [ -4+3+1, 3+0+0, -6+9+0; -3+6+0, -2+3+1, -4-3+0; 0+3+0, 2-3+0, -5+3+1 ]) Tj
T*
(   = [ 0 3 3 ]) Tj
T*
(   [ 3 2 -7 ]) Tj
T*
(   [ 3 -1 -1 ]) Tj
T*
(   A^-1 = \(1/9\) * [ 0 3 3; 3 2 -7; 3 -1 -1 ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Compute A^4:) Tj
T*
ET

