T*
(   * u_i^T\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Verification of Projection Properties:) Tj
T*
(   - P_i^2 = \(u_i * u_i^T\) * \(u_i * u_i^T\) = u_i * \(u_i^T * u_i\) * u_i^T = u_i * \(1\) * u_i^T =) Tj
T*
(   P_i.) Tj
T*
(   - For i != j: P_i * P_j = \(u_i * u_i^T\) * \(u_j * u_j^T\) = u_i * \(u_i^T * u_j\) * u_j^T = u_i *) Tj
T*
(   \(0\) * u_j^T = O.) Tj
T*
(   - Resolution of identity: Q * Q^T = I => sum_{i=1}^n u_i * u_i^T = I.) Tj
T*
(   - Rank: Since u_i != 0, dim\(Col\(u_i * u_i^T\)\) = 1, so each P_i has rank 1. Hence proved.) Tj
