(   [Problem Statement]: Reduce the quadratic form Q = 3*x1^2 + 5*x2^2 + 3*x3^2 - 2*x1*x2 + 2*x1*x3 - 2*x2*x3 to canonical form by orthogonal transformation. Determine its rank, index, signature, and nature.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Write down the Symmetric Matrix A of the Quadratic Form:) Tj
T*
(   Diagonal entries: a11 = 3, a22 = 5, a33 = 3.) Tj
T*
(   Off-diagonal entries: a12 = a21 = -1, a13 = a31 = 1, a23 = a32 = -1.) Tj
T*
