T*
(   => x = Delta_x / Delta = \(-2\) / \(-2\) = 1.) Tj
T*
(   - Step \(c\): Compute Delta_y = det\(A_2\) by replacing column 2 with [9, 6, 2]^T:) Tj
T*
(   | 2 9 3 |) Tj
T*
(   | 1 6 1 | = 2\(6 - 2\) - 9\(1 - 1\) + 3\(2 - 6\) = 2\(4\) - 0 + 3\(-4\) = 8 - 12 = -4.) Tj
T*
(   => y = Delta_y / Delta = \(-4\) / \(-2\) = 2.) Tj
T*
(   - Step \(d\): Compute Delta_z = det\(A_3\) by replacing column 3 with [9, 6, 2]^T:) Tj
T*
(   | 2 -1 9 |) Tj
T*
(   | 1 1 6 | = 2\(2 - \(-6\)\) - \(-1\)\(2 - 6\) + 9\(-1 - 1\) = 2\(8\) + 1\(-4\) + 9\(-2\) = 16 - 4 - 18 = -6.) Tj
T*
(   => z = Delta_z / Delta = \(-6\) / \(-2\) = 3.) Tj
T*
(   Final Solution:) Tj
T*
(   x = 1, y = 2, z = 3.) Tj
T*
(   Verification:) Tj
T*
(   2\(1\) - 2 + 3\(3\) = 2 - 2 + 9 = 9 \(Correct\).) Tj
T*
(   1 + 2 + 3 = 6 \(Correct\).) Tj
T*
(   1 - 2 + 3 = 2 \(Correct\).) Tj
